{"id":"pb-004","title":"阅读器图片视频就绪与真实播放","scope":"production-browser","probe":"reader_media_ready_playback","input":{"scenario":"approved completed book reader","sample":{"kind":"synthetic","expected_images":["frame.jpg"],"expected_videos":["clip.mp4"],"assets":[{"name":"frame.jpg","exists":true,"bytes":100},{"name":"clip.mp4","exists":true,"bytes":200,"ffprobe_exit_code":0,"duration_s":20}],"samples":[{"elapsed_ms":0,"visibility":"visible","decoded_images":0,"loading_count":2,"videos":[]},{"elapsed_ms":12000,"visibility":"visible","decoded_images":1,"loading_count":0,"videos":[{"label":"clip.mp4","ready_state":4,"error":0}]}],"playback":{"action":"play","label":"clip.mp4","paused":false,"before_s":0.0,"after_s":1.5,"duration_s":20.0,"error":0}}},"expectedOutput":{"checks":["reader_media_ready_playback"],"criteria":["附件 manifest 与实际非空文件一致","前台 60 秒内所有图片解码、视频 readyState>=2 且无错误","点击播放后 currentTime 增长，不能仅凭后端文件或正文可读判定通过"]},"counterexamples":[{"name":"zero-dom-videos","check":"reader_media_ready_playback","path":"/samples/1/videos","value":[]},{"name":"video-decode-error","check":"reader_media_ready_playback","path":"/samples/1/videos/0/error","value":3},{"name":"late-ready","check":"reader_media_ready_playback","path":"/samples/1/elapsed_ms","value":60001},{"name":"time-does-not-advance","check":"reader_media_ready_playback","path":"/playback/after_s","value":0.0}],"metadata":{"title":"阅读器媒体必须真实可播放","area":"reader-media","source":"production-browser-observation-2026-10-26","historical_outcome":"fail","offline_can_close_production":false,"regressions":["frontend/web/tests/reader.integration.test.mjs","backend/tests/test_reader_readiness_eval.py::test_invalid_readiness_cannot_pass"],"production_evidence_required":["两章前台时间序列、图片解码、视频 readyState/error、播放前后 currentTime；当前“无法播放媒体”必须保持 fail。"],"privacy":"只记录媒体文件名和状态，不记录用户数据。"}}
